"Jacob is a boy on Anesidora with the talent Device Identification."
"He delivered a cooler of drugs to Orpheus Velra in exchange for a stolen Submerger."
"He denies being a drug dealer and wants the device to help him and those helping him."
"Orpheus's sister photographed him and says he will someday have to pay off the debt."
"He befriended Maricel in intake and had tried to escape Anesidora before."
"In late November he fled Anesidora by boat at night with the outlaws Superhumans at Large."
"He gave them the Submerger, only their second, and they call him a hero."
"His full name is Jacob Moore; he is a seventeen-year-old C-rank Wright."
"He makes detector flashlights that show flaws in enchanted objects as hot pink."
"His father says the System chooses only mentally weak people."
"His mother in California keeps writing to him after his texts stopped."
"He died on the SAL boat that hit Matadero; his father is a Presixter, a fringe alien-hater."
